  <item> <link url="https://characterlab.org/tips-of-the-week/success-story-tips/">Success Story</link> </item>
</list>
<para>You can find other tips located here in the <link url="https://characterlab.org/playbooks/grit/">Playbook on Grit</link> from Character Lab.</para></section>
